sequenceDiagram
    participant CLI as CLI / main.py
    participant Analyzer as Analysis Boundary
    participant Bridge as FTR Bridge
    participant Validator as Schema Validator
    participant Output as results.json
    CLI->>Analyzer: run_analysis_session(request)
    Analyzer-->>CLI: AnalysisResult with risk label and evidence notes
    CLI->>Bridge: build_ftr_result_from_analysis(...)
    Bridge->>Bridge: normalize plate and map labels
    Bridge->>Validator: FtrCompetitionResult.from_dict(payload)
    Validator-->>Bridge: exact keys, labels, confidence, timestamp checks
    Bridge->>Output: write_ftr_result(...)
